---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import J from '../../components/J.astro';
export { paths as getStaticPaths } from '../../data/paths';
const { lang } = Astro.params; const ja = lang==='ja';
---
<Base lang={lang} page="agent" title={ja?'エージェント':'Agent'}>
<h1>{ja?'しごと探しのエージェント':'My job-search research agent'}</h1>
{ja ? <>
<J en="Looking for jobs in Japan by hand took a lot of time. So I made a small program that runs on my laptop.">日本の仕事を手でさがすのは、時間がかかりました。そこで、自分のパソコンで動く小さなプログラムを作りました。</J>
<J en="It searches the web, an AI scores each listing, and the results are saved to a Notion table. It costs only a small part of what paid AI tools cost.">ウェブで求人をさがし、AIがそれぞれに点数をつけ、結果をNotionの表に保存します。有料のAIツールより、ずっと安く動きます。</J>
<J en="Problems that repeat are written down in a 'Not working yet' list.">何度もおきる問題は「まだ動かない」リストに書いておきます。</J>
</> : <>
<p>Searching Japan listings by hand was slow, so I built a pipeline that runs on my own laptop.</p>
<ol><li>Searches the web for listings.</li><li>Scores each listing with an LLM.</li><li>Saves results to a Notion table; repeated failures are logged under "Not working yet".</li></ol>
<p>It handles job discovery at a fraction of the API cost of hosted tools. A cost-per-run breakdown (full run and per section) will be added after a measured run.</p>
</>}
<p class="muted">{ja?'コードは非公開です。':'The code is private.'}</p>
</Base>
